{"id":579,"date":"2026-07-30T15:55:14","date_gmt":"2026-07-30T20:55:14","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/dev-nube-para-pymes.pantheonsite.io\/?p=579"},"modified":"2026-08-22T12:47:10","modified_gmt":"2026-08-22T17:47:10","slug":"gestion-academias-online","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/dev-nube-para-pymes.pantheonsite.io\/gestion-academias-online\/","title":{"rendered":"Herramientas de Gesti\u00f3n para Academias Online de Idiomas y Matem\u00e1ticas"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\u00bfTu academia ya dicta todas sus clases por videollamada pero sigue usando una hoja de c\u00e1lculo para llevar el registro de alumnos? Un buen software de gesti\u00f3n para academias online centraliza matr\u00edculas, pagos y clases en vivo en un solo lugar. Por eso, muchas academias reci\u00e9n buscan esta soluci\u00f3n cuando ya perdieron el registro de qui\u00e9n asisti\u00f3 a una clase virtual.<\/p><p class=\"npp-rm90-source\"><strong>Fuente oficial:<\/strong> <a href=\"https:\/\/academygest.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">sitio oficial de AcademyGest<\/a>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div id=\"ez-toc-container\" class=\"ez-toc-v2_0_87_1 counter-hierarchy ez-toc-counter ez-toc-grey ez-toc-container-direction\">\n<div class=\"ez-toc-title-container\">\n<p class=\"ez-toc-title\" style=\"cursor:inherit\">Tabla de Contenidos<\/p>\n<span class=\"ez-toc-title-toggle\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"ez-toc-pull-right ez-toc-btn ez-toc-btn-xs ez-toc-btn-default ez-toc-toggle\" aria-label=\"Alternar tabla de contenidos\"><span class=\"ez-toc-js-icon-con\"><span class=\"\"><span class=\"eztoc-hide\" style=\"display:none;\">Toggle<\/span><span class=\"ez-toc-icon-toggle-span\"><svg style=\"fill: #999;color:#999\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" class=\"list-377408\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M6 6H4v2h2V6zm14 0H8v2h12V6zM4 11h2v2H4v-2zm16 0H8v2h12v-2zM4 16h2v2H4v-2zm16 0H8v2h12v-2z\" fill=\"currentColor\